    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.poster.avif?t=1753687188\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.webm?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.mp4?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr Figs is a challenging top-down action puzzler where you play as Mr Figs - an adorable squid-like humanoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with as many bombs as you can carry, blast,\u00a0manoeuvre and puzzle your way out of countless levels and areas, trying to reach the depths below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ levels across 4 different areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and &quot;aha!&quot; moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret challenge rooms (shh don't tell anyone)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle yourself out of tricky situations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/930b40caa725d1b27bb0b97d16862a62.poster.avif?t=1753687188\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/930b40caa725d1b27bb0b97d16862a62.webm?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/930b40caa725d1b27bb0b97d16862a62.mp4?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blow up things</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/2fadf769024d7c006bb8ba154f01d116.poster.avif?t=1753687188\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/2fadf769024d7c006bb8ba154f01d116.webm?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/2fadf769024d7c006bb8ba154f01d116.mp4?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And get used to danger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/34d49546af9e4050656bdb2b8a5a4ee8.poster.avif?t=1753687188\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/34d49546af9e4050656bdb2b8a5a4ee8.webm?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/34d49546af9e4050656bdb2b8a5a4ee8.mp4?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.poster.avif?t=1753687188\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.webm?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.mp4?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr Figs is a challenging top-down action puzzler where you play as Mr Figs - an adorable squid-like humanoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with as many bombs as you can carry, blast,\u00a0manoeuvre and puzzle your way out of countless levels and areas, trying to reach the depths below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ levels across 4 different areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and &quot;aha!&quot; moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret challenge rooms (shh don't tell anyone)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle yourself out of tricky situations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/930b40caa725d1b27bb0b97d16862a62.poster.avif?t=1753687188\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/930b40caa725d1b27bb0b97d16862a62.webm?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/930b40caa725d1b27bb0b97d16862a62.mp4?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blow up things</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/2fadf769024d7c006bb8ba154f01d116.poster.avif?t=1753687188\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/2fadf769024d7c006bb8ba154f01d116.webm?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/2fadf769024d7c006bb8ba154f01d116.mp4?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And get used to danger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/34d49546af9e4050656bdb2b8a5a4ee8.poster.avif?t=1753687188\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/34d49546af9e4050656bdb2b8a5a4ee8.webm?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/34d49546af9e4050656bdb2b8a5a4ee8.mp4?t=1753687188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
